  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "667-root",
    "title": "E-marking begins at Aga Khan University Examination Board",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "AKU-EB examinations are all marked electronically.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "f3c6b90568195624",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "667-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/667-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "E-marking begins at Aga Khan University Examination Board"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Following the SSC composite examinations conducted by Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) in May 2007 the marking of scripts have begun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AKU-EB examinations are all marked electronically. The MCQ papers are marked through the e-Scoring method whereas all CRQs are marked through the e-Marking software."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A team of over 300 markers and senior markers will be marking the CRQs at two locations, that is, Karachi and Lahore. AKU-EB aims to complete its marking within three weeks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Computer-assisted marking not only protects the candidate against marker error but also enables marking to be completed on a timely basis as well as providing valuable analysis of student performance by subject and areas that need improvement."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The integrity and transparency of its examinations are major priorities for AKU-EB."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
